hadiths[45]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1111","[AI-translation] Buraida se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab kisi ameer ko lashkar ya dastay par ameer banatay to usay khaas taur par Allah ka taqwa aur us ke saath Musalmanon se bhalaai ki wasiyyat kartay, phir farmatay: Allah ke naam se, Allah ke rastay mein jang karo. Jo Allah se kufr karay us se jang karo. Jang karo, maal-e-ghaneemat mein khayanat na karo, ahad na toro, naak kaan na kaato aur bachay ko qatl na karo. Aur jab tum apne dushman mushrikon se milo to unhein teen khaslaton ki taraf bulao, un mein se jo bhi qabool karein usay un se qabool karo aur un se haath rok lo. Phir unhein Islam ki taraf bulao, agar wo qabool karein to un se qabool karo aur un se haath rok lo. Phir unhein apne ghar se hijrat walon ke ghar ki taraf muntaqil honay ki taraf bulao, aur unhein batao ke agar wo aisa karein to un ke liye wohi hai jo hijrat walon ke liye hai aur un par wohi hai jo hijrat walon par hai. Phir agar wo muntaqil honay se inkar karein to unhein batao ke wo dehati Musalmanon ki tarah honge, un par Allah ka wohi hukm jari hoga jo mominon par jari hota hai, aur un ke liye maal-e-ghaneemat aur fai mein kuch na hoga siwae is ke ke wo Musalmanon ke saath jihad karein. Phir agar wo inkar karein to un se jizya mango, agar wo qabool karein to un se qabool karo aur un se haath rok lo. Phir agar wo inkar karein to Allah se madad mango aur un se jang karo. Aur jab tum qila walon ka muhasra karo aur wo tum se chahein ke tum un ke liye Allah ka zimma aur Us ke Nabi ka zimma rakho to un ke liye Allah ka zimma aur Us ke Nabi ka zimma na rakho, lekin un ke liye apna zimma aur apne saathiyon ka zimma rakho, beshak tumhara apne aur apne saathiyon ke zimmay tor dena Allah ke zimmay aur Us ke Rasool ke zimmay tor denay se halka hai. Aur jab tum qila walon ka muhasra karo aur wo chahein ke tum unhein Allah ke hukm par utaro to unhein Allah ke hukm par na utaro, lekin unhein apne hukm par utaro, beshak tum nahi jantay ke tum un mein Allah ke hukm ko pao ge ya nahi. Abdur Rahman, yani Ibn Mahdi, ne kaha: Ye ya is jaisa. (Muslim: 5/140). Baab: Lashkaron ko aasani ka hukm denay ke baaray mein. (Taghullu se murad maal-e-ghaneemat mein khayanat hai; tamseel se murad qatl honay walon ke naak kaan kaat kar bigaarna hai; waleed se murad bacha hai; dar-ul-muhajireen se murad dar-ul-Islam hai.)"
"1112","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Muslim mein hai ke Muhammad bin Abu Burda se, apne walid se, apne dada se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein aur Muaz ko Yemen ki taraf bheja aur farmaya: Aasani karo, sakhti na karo, khushkhabri do, nafrat na dilao, aik doosray ki mano, ikhtilaf na karo. (Muslim: 5/141). Baab: Lashkaron aur baith nay walay ki taraf se nikal nay walay ki niyabat ke baaray mein."
"1113","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Banu Lihyan ki taraf lashkar bheja aur farmaya: Har ghar se do mardon mein se aik niklay. Phir Aap ne peechay rehnay walon se farmaya: Jo nikal nay walay ke ghar aur maal ki dekh bhaal karay to usay mujahid ke ajar ka aadha milay ga. (Muslim). (Asal mein ba'san ka izafa hai jo Muslim mein asal mein nahi aaya.)"
"1114","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Uhud ke din laraai mein mera muaina kiya jabke main chaudah saal ka tha to Aap ne mujhe ijazat nahi di. Aur Khandaq ke din mera muaina kiya jabke main pandra saal ka tha to Aap ne mujhe ijazat de di. Nafi ne kaha: To main Umar bin Abdul Aziz (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya jabke wo us din khalifa thay. To main ne unhein ye hadees bayan ki. To unhon ne kaha: Beshak ye chotay aur baray ke darmiyan had hai. To unhon ne apne aamilon ko likha ke jo pandra saal ka ho us ka wazeefa muqarrar karo aur jo is se kam ho usay bachon mein rakho. (Muslim: 6/30). Baab: Quran le kar dushman ki zameen ki taraf safar karnay se mumaniat. (Arz karna se murad haal maloom karnay ke liye dekhna hai; ijazat na denay se murad laraai ki ijazat na dena hai.)"
"1115","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap dushman ki zameen ki taraf Quran le kar safar karnay se mana farmatay thay, is khauf se ke dushman usay paa le. (Muslim: 6/30). Baab: Sarsabzi aur qehat mein safar aur raat ko rastay par qiyam ke baaray mein."
"1116","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum sarsabzi mein safar karo to oonton ko zameen se un ka hissa do, aur jab tum qehat mein safar karo to un par tez chalo, aur jab tum raat ko qiyam karo to rastay se bacho, beshak wo raat ko keeron ka thikana hai. (Muslim: 6/54). Baab: Safar azaab ka tukra hai. (Sana se murad qehat hai; Firaun walon ko qehat mein pakra gaya tha.)"
"1117","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Safar azaab ka tukra hai, tum mein se aik ki neend, us ka khana aur us ka peena rokta hai. To jab tum mein se koi apni haajat poori kar le to apne ghar walon ki taraf jaldi wapas aaye. (Muslim: 6/55). Baab: Raat ko safar se aa kar ghar walon par achanak dakhil honay ki karahat. (Nahmat se murad haajat hai.)"
"1118","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mana farmaya ke mard raat ko apne ghar walon par achanak aaye aur un par khayanat ka guman karay ya un ke aib talash karay. (Muslim: 6/56). (Asal mein yatlub tha, Muslim se tasheeh ki gayi.)"
"1119","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) raat ko apne ghar walon par achanak na aatay thay, Aap subah ya shaam aatay thay. (Muslim: 6/55). Baab: Laraai se pehle dua aur dushman par achanak hamlay ke baaray mein."
"1120","[AI-translation] Ibn Aun se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nafi ko laraai se pehle (Islam ki) dawat ke baaray mein likha. To unhon ne mujhe likha ke ye sirf Islam ke awwal mein tha. Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Banu Mustaliq par hamla kiya jabke wo ghafil thay aur un ke maweshi pani par pilaye ja rahay thay. To Aap ne un ke larnay walon ko qatl kiya aur un ke qaidiyon ko qaidi banaya, aur us din (qaidiyon mein) Juwayriya bint Haris hasil huin. Aur mujhe ye hadees Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan ki, aur wo us lashkar mein thay. (Muslim: 5/139). Baab: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baadshahon ko Allah ki taraf bulanay walay khatoot."
"1121","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Kisra, Qaisar, Najashi aur har sarkash ko khat likha jis mein unhein Allah Taala ki taraf bulatay thay. Aur ye wo Najashi nahi jis par Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne (janaza ki) namaz padhi thi. (Muslim: 5/166). Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka Hiraql ko Islam ki taraf bulanay wala khat."
"1122","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Abu Sufyan ne unhein apne munh se un ke munh tak (barah-e-raast) bataya, unhon ne kaha: Main us muddat mein nikla jo mere aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darmiyan thi, sulah-e-Hudaibiya ki muddat. Unhon ne kaha: To jabke main Shaam mein tha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka khat Hiraql, yani Room ke baray, ke paas laya gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Dihya Kalbi usay le kar aaye thay, to unhon ne usay Busra ke baray ko diya, phir Busra ke baray ne usay Hiraql ko diya. To Hiraql ne kaha: Kya yahan us shakhs ki qaum mein se koi hai jo nabuwwat ka daawa karta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: To mujhe Quraish ke chand afraad sameet bulaya gaya. To ham Hiraql ke paas dakhil hue to us ne hamein apne saamnay bithaya. To us ne kaha: Tum mein se is shakhs se nasab mein zyada qareeb kaun hai jo nabuwwat ka daawa karta hai? To Abu Sufyan ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Main. To unhon ne mujhe apne saamnay bithaya aur mere saathiyon ko mere peechay bithaya. Phir us ne apne tarjuman ko bulaya aur us se kaha: Un se kaho ke main is se us aadmi ke baaray mein poochhun ga jo nabuwwat ka daawa karta hai. Agar wo jhoot bolay to tum usay jhutla dena. Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Agar mujhe ye khauf na hota ke mujh par jhoot ki tohmat lagay gi to main (Aap ke baaray mein) jhoot bolta. Phir Hiraql ne apne tarjuman se kaha: Us se is aadmi, yani Muhammad, ke baaray mein poocho, us ka nasab kaisa hai? Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Un ka nasab ham mein bohat aala hai. Hiraql ne poocha: Kya us ke baap dada mein koi baadshah tha? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Hiraql ne kaha: Us ke daaway se pehle kya tum ne usay kabhi jhoot boltay suna? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Hiraql ne kaha: Acha! Us ki pairwi baray log kartay hain ya kamzor? Main ne kaha: Kamzor. Hiraql ne kaha: Kya wo badhtay hain ya ghat-tay hain? Main ne kaha: Badhtay hain. Hiraql ne kaha: Kya un mein se koi apne deen mein dakhil honay ke baad naaraaz ho kar phirta hai? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Hiraql ne kaha: Kya tum us par is se pehle jhoot ki tohmat lagatay thay jo us ne kaha? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Hiraql ne kaha: Kya wo dhoka deta hai? Main ne kaha: Nahi, aur ham us se aik muddat mein hain, ham nahi jantay wo us mein kya karay ga. Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Mujhe is kalimay ke siwa koi baat daakhil karnay ka mauqa na mila. Hiraql ne kaha: Kya tum us se laray ho? Main ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Tumhari us se laraai kaisi rahi? Main ne kaha: Hamaray aur us ke darmiyan laraai daul (baari) hai, kabhi wo ham par ghalib aata hai aur kabhi ham us par ghalib aatay hain. Hiraql ne kaha: Wo tumhein kis ka hukm deta hai? Main ne kaha: Wo kehta hai: Aik Allah ki ibadat karo, us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, aur jo tumharay baap dada kehtay thay usay chhor do. Aur wo hamein namaz, sachai, paakdamni aur sila rehmi ka hukm deta hai. To Hiraql ne apne tarjuman se kaha: Us se kaho ke main ne tum se us ke nasab ke baaray mein poocha to tum ne bataya ke wo tum mein aala nasab wala hai, aur Rasool isi tarah logon ke aala nasab mein bhejay jatay hain. Aur main ne tum se poocha ke kya us ke baap dada mein koi baadshah tha to tum ne kaha nahi, aur agar us ke baap dada mein koi baadshah hota to main kehta ke wo apne baap ki baadshahat talab karta hai. Aur main ne tum se poocha ke kya tum us par jhoot ki tohmat lagatay thay to tum ne kaha nahi, to main ne samjha ke wo aisa nahi ke logon par jhoot chhor de aur Allah par jhoot bandhay. Aur main ne tum se poocha ke baray us ki pairwi kartay hain ya kamzor to tum ne bataya ke kamzor, aur wohi Rasoolon ke pairwakar hotay hain. Aur main ne tum se poocha ke wo badhtay hain ya ghat-tay hain to tum ne bataya ke badhtay hain, aur iman ka muamla yahi hai yahan tak ke poora ho jata hai. Aur main ne tum se poocha ke kya un mein se koi apne deen mein dakhil honay ke baad naaraaz ho kar phirta hai to tum ne kaha nahi, aur iman ka muamla yahi hai jab us ki khushi dilon mein sama jaye. Aur main ne tum se poocha ke kya wo dhoka deta hai to tum ne kaha nahi, aur Rasool isi tarah hotay hain, dhoka nahi detay. Aur main ne tum se poocha ke wo tumhein kis ka hukm deta hai to tum ne bataya ke wo tumhein aik Allah ki ibadat ka hukm deta hai, us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, aur tumhein buton ki ibadat se manay karta hai, aur tumhein namaz, sachai aur paakdamni ka hukm deta hai. To agar jo tum ne kaha sach hai to wo jald mere in qadmon ki jagah ka maalik ho ga. Aur beshak main janta tha ke wo zaahir honay wala hai, lekin main nahi samajhta tha ke wo tum mein se ho ga. Aur agar main janta ke main us tak pahunch sakta hun to us se milnay ki koshish karta, aur agar main us ke paas hota to us ke qadam dho-ta. Phir us ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka khat mangwaya aur wo padha gaya jis mein tha: Allah ke naam se jo bara meherban nihayat rehem wala hai. Muhammad, Allah ke Rasool ki taraf se, Hiraql, Room ke baray ki taraf. Jo hidayat ki pairwi karay us par salam ho. Amma baad! Beshak main tumhein Islam ki dawat deta hun. Islam lao, salamti pao ge, Allah tumhein tumhara ajar dohra de ga. Aur agar tum munh moro ge to tum par kashkaron ka gunah hoga. Aur Ae kitab walon! Aisi baat ki taraf aao jo hamaray aur tumharay darmiyan barabar hai: Ke ham Allah ke siwa kisi ki ibadat na karein, us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karein, aur ham mein se koi kisi ko Allah ke siwa Rab na banaye. Phir agar wo munh morein to kaho: Gawah raho ke ham Musalman hain. Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Phir jab us ne apni baat poori ki aur khat padha gaya to wahan shor buland ho gaya aur awazein tez ho gayeen, aur hamein nikalnay ka hukm diya gaya to ham nikal aaye. To main ne apne saathiyon se kaha: Beshak Ibn Abu Kabsha ka muamla bara ho gaya hai, us se Room ka baadshah darta hai. To main musalsal yaqeen rakhta raha ke Aap ghalib aayein ge yahan tak ke Allah ne mujhe Islam mein dakhil kiya. (Muslim)."
"1123","[AI-translation] Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) gaday par sawaar hue jis par kajaawa tha jis ke neechay Fadak ki chadar thi, aur Aap ne apne peechay Usama ko bithaya. Aap Sa'd bin Ubada ki iyadat ko ja rahay thay Banu Haris bin Khazraj mein, aur ye Badr ki laraai se pehle tha, yahan tak ke Aap aik majlis ke paas se guzray jis mein Musalmanon, buton ke pujari mushrikon aur Yahud ka mila jula majma tha, un mein Abdullah bin Ubay tha, aur majlis mein Abdullah bin Rawaha thay. Phir jab sawari ki dhool majlis par chha gayi to Abdullah bin Ubay ne apni chadar se apni naak dhaanp li, phir kaha: Ham par dhool na urao. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein salam kiya, phir thehray, utray, unhein Allah ki taraf bulaya aur unhein Quran padh kar sunaya. To Abdullah bin Ubay ne kaha: Ae shakhs! Is se behtar kuch nahi agar jo tum kehtay ho sach hai. To hamari majlison mein hamein takleef na do aur apne thikanay ki taraf wapas jao, jo ham mein se tumharay paas aaye usay (sunao). To Abdullah bin Rawaha (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Nahi, balke Aap hamari har majlis mein zaroor aayein, ham isay bohat pasand kartay hain. To Musalman, mushrik aur Yahud aik doosray par toot paray yahan tak ke qareeb tha ke lar paray. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) unhein thanda karnay lagay yahan tak ke khamosh ho gaye. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sawaar hue aur Sa'd bin Ubada ke paas aaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Sa'd! Kya tum ne nahi suna jo Abu Hubab ne kaha? Us ne aisa aisa kaha. To Sa'd bin Ubada ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Usay muaf kar dijiye aur darguzar farmaiye. Allah ki qasam! Allah ne Aap ko wo diya jo Aap ko diya. Aur Yathrib walon ne is par ittefaq kiya tha ke usay sardar banaein aur usay taaj pehnayein. Phir jab Allah ne usay radd kar diya jo Aap ke zariye haq aaya tha, to wo (hasad se) jal bhuna, aur usi ne ye kiya jo tum ne dekha. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay muaf kar diya. Aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke sahaba mushrikon aur kitab walon se darguzar kartay thay jaisa Allah ne unhein hukm diya tha, aur un se takleef par sabar kartay thay. Allah Taala ne farmaya: Tum zaroor apne maalon aur apni jaanon mein aazmaye jao ge, aayat. Aur us waqt Sa'd bin Ubada ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak jo aap ne kaha wo haq hai. (Muslim). (Ikaf gaday ke liye kajaway ki tarah hai; Madina murad hai; Abu Hubab Abdullah bin Ubay ki kuniyat hai.)"
"1124","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har dhokebaaz ke liye qayamat ke din aik jhanda hoga jo us ki dhokebaazi ke andazay se buland kiya jaye ga. Khabardar! Aam logon ke ameer se bara koi dhokebaaz nahi. (Muslim: 5/143). Baab: Ahad pura karnay ke baaray mein."
"1125","[AI-translation] Huzaifa bin Yaman (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Badr mein haazir honay se sirf is ne roka ke main aur mere walid Husail niklay. Unhon ne kaha: To hamein kuffar-e-Quraish ne pakar liya. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak tum Muhammad (ke paas jana) chahtay ho. To ham ne kaha: Ham usay nahi chahtay, ham sirf Madina chahtay hain. To unhon ne ham se Allah ka ahad aur misaq liya ke ham Madina ki taraf wapas jayein ge aur us ke saath mil kar nahi larein ge. To ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap ko khabar sunayi. To Aap ne farmaya: Wapas jao, ham un ka ahad poora karein ge aur un par Allah se madad maangein ge. (Muslim: 5/177). Baab: Dushman se milnay ki tamanna chhorna, aur jab milein to sabar karna. (Husail Huzaifa ke walid ka naam hai, Yaman un ka laqab hai.)"
"1126","[AI-translation] Abun Nadr se, Aslam qabeelay ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se aik mard, jinhein Abdullah bin Abu Aufa kaha jata hai, ki kitab se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ko likha jab wo Haruriya, yani Khawarij ki taraf (laraai ke liye) niklay, aur wo unhein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sunnat batana chahtay thay: Ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dushman se laraai ke dinon mein sooraj dhalnay tak intezar kartay, phir logon mein khaday hotay aur farmatay: Ae logon! Dushman se milnay ki tamanna na karo, aur Allah se aafiyat mango. Lekin jab tum un se milo to sabar karo, aur jaan lo ke jannat talwaron ke saaye talay hai. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khaday hue aur yun dua ki: Ae Allah! Kitab naazil karnay walay, badalon ko chalanay walay, girohon ko shikast denay walay, unhein shikast de aur hamein un par fatah de. (Muslim). (Haruriya Khawarij hain jo Harura ki taraf mansoob hain, wo Kufa se do meel par aik jagah hai jahan Khawarij ka pehla ijtima hua tha.)"
"1127","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Uhud ke din kehtay thay: Ae Allah! Beshak agar Tu chahay to zameen mein ibadat na ki jaye. (Muslim: 5/144). Baab: Jang dhoka hai. (Murad kuffar ka Musalmanon par ghalib aana hai, us shariat ke saath ibadat na hona jo aakhri shariat hai; Aap ne ye Uhud ke din kaha, aur Badr ke din bhi aisa kaha.)"
"1128","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jang dhoka hai. (Muslim: 5/143). Baab: Ghazway mein mushrikon se madad lena."
"1129","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha), Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja, se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Badr ki taraf niklay. Phir jab Harrat-ul-Wabra mein thay to Aap ko aik mard mila jis ki bahaduri aur mardangi mashhoor thi. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba khush hue jab unhon ne usay dekha. Phir jab wo Aap se mila to us ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha: Main aaya hun taake tumhari pairwi karun aur tumharay saath (maal) hasil karun. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tum Allah aur Us ke Rasool par iman rakhtay ho? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Wapas jao, main mushrik se madad nahi lun ga. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap chalay yahan tak ke jab Shajara mein thay to wo mard Aap se mila aur us ne Aap se waisa hi kaha jaisa pehli baar kaha tha. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se waisa hi kaha jaisa pehli baar kaha tha. Aap ne farmaya: Wapas jao, main mushrik se madad nahi lun ga. Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo wapas gaya, phir Baida mein Aap se mila aur us ne Aap se waisa hi kaha jaisa pehli baar kaha tha: Kya tum Allah aur Us ke Rasool par iman rakhtay ho? Us ne kaha: Haan. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Chalo. (Muslim: 5/201). Baab: Ghaziyon ke saath auraton ka nikalna. (Harrat-ul-Wabra Madina se chaar meel par aik jagah hai, Zul Hulaifa se pehle.)"
"1130","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai ke Umm Sulaim (raziyallahu anhuma) ne Hunain ke din khanjar liya aur wo un ke paas tha. To Abu Talha ne usay dekha aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se us ka zikr kiya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne (Umm Sulaim se) poocha: Ye khanjar kaisa hai? To Umm Sulaim (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Agar mujh se koi mushrik qareeb aaye to main us ka pait is se phaad dun. To ye sun kar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hansay. Phir Umm Sulaim (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Tulaqa, yani Makka walon ko hamaray siwa qatl kar dijiye, beshak wo aap se shikast khanay ke baad Musalman hue. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Umm Sulaim! Allah ne hamein kuffar ke shar se behtareen kifayat ki hai. (Muslim). (Tulaqa wo hain jo Fatah Makka ke din Musalman hue; Umm Sulaim ne samjha ke wo munafiq hain.)"
"1131","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Uhud ka din tha to logon mein se kuch log Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se shikast kha kar bhagay, aur Abu Talha Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saamnay Aap par dhaal liye hue thay. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abu Talha teerandaz, sakht kheench nay walay mard thay, aur us din unhon ne do ya teen kamanain tor din. Unhon ne kaha: To jis mard ke paas teeron ka tarqash hota wo guzarta to Aap farmatay: Usay Abu Talha ke liye bikher do. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon ko dekhnay ke liye sar uthatay to Abu Talha kehtay: Ae Allah ke Nabi! Mere maan baap Aap par qurban, sar na uthaiye, qaum ke teeron mein se koi teer Aap ko na lagay, meri gardan Aap ki gardan se aagay hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur beshak main ne Aisha bint Abu Bakr aur Umm Sulaim (raziyallahu anhuma) ko dekha jabke wo donon kapray samaitay hue thin, main un ki pindliyon ke ghungroo dekhta tha, wo apni peethon par mashkizein utha kar lati thin phir unhein un ke munhon mein undeltin thin, phir wapas ja kar unhein bhartin thin phir aa kar qaum ke munhon mein undeltin thin. Aur Abu Talha ke haath se talwaar oongh ki wajah se do ya teen baar giri. (Muslim: 5/196). (Mujawwib se murad Aap ko kuffar ke hathyar se bachanay ke liye dhaal banana hai; khadam khalkhaal ki jama hai; saq jama hai pindli ki; asal mein zaaid ibarat thi jo Muslim ya Bukhari mein nahi, usay hazf kiya gaya.)"
"1132","[AI-translation] Umm Atiya Ansariya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath saat ghazwaat mein shirkat ki, main un ke saman mein un ke peechay rehti, un ke liye khana banati, zakhmiyon ka ilaj karti aur beemaron ki dekh bhaal karti. (Muslim: 5/199). Baab: Ghazway mein auraton aur bachon ke qatl se mumaniat."
"1133","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Un ghazwaat mein se baaz mein aik maqtula aurat payi gayi. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne auraton aur bachon ke qatl se mana farmaya. (Muslim: 5/144). Baab: Raat ke hamlay mein dushman ke bachon ko jo lag jaye."
"1134","[AI-translation] Sa'b bin Jassama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mushrikon ke bachon ke baaray mein poocha gaya jin par raat ko hamla kiya jaye aur un ki auraton aur bachon ko lag jaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo unhi mein se hain. (Muslim: 5/144). Baab: Dushman ki khajooron ka kaatna aur jalana."
"1135","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Banu Nazeer ki khajoorein kaatin aur jalayein. (Muslim). (Lina se murad narm khajoor hai; aayat ka baqiya: To Allah ke izn se hai taake nafarmanon ko ruswa karay.)"
"1136","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mughaffal (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Khaibar ke din charbi ka thaila mila. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne usay pakar liya aur kaha: Aaj is mein se kisi ko kuch nahi dun ga. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne mur kar dekha to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) muskuratay hue thay. (Muslim: 5/163). Baab: Maal-e-ghaneemat ka is ummat ke liye khaas halal hona. (Jirab chamray ka bartan hai.)"
"1137","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nabiyon mein se aik Nabi ne ghazwa kiya, wo Yusha bin Noon thay, to unhon ne apni qaum se kaha: Mere saath wo mard na chalay jis ne aurat ka hissa (nikah se) haasil kiya ho aur wo us se ghar basana chahta ho magar abhi basaya na ho, aur na wo jis ne imarat banayi ho magar us ki chhatein buland na ki hon, aur na wo jis ne bakriyan ya hamila oontniyan khareedi hon aur wo un ke jan-nay ka intezar karta ho. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne ghazwa kiya aur Asr ki namaz ke waqt ya us ke qareeb basti, yani Bait-ul-Muqaddas, ke qareeb pahunche. To unhon ne sooraj se kaha: Tum bhi hukm ki paband ho aur main bhi hukm ka paband hun. Ae Allah! Usay mujh par thori dair rok de. To usay un par rok diya gaya yahan tak ke Allah ne unhein fatah di. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne jo ghaneemat haasil ki usay jama kiya. To aag aayi taake usay khaye magar us ne usay khanay se inkar kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Tum mein khayanat hai. To har qabeelay se aik mard meri bai'at karay. To unhon ne bai'at ki to aik mard ka haath un ke haath se chipak gaya. To unhon ne kaha: Tum mein khayanat hai. To tumhara qabeela meri bai'at karay. To us ne bai'at ki. Unhon ne kaha: To do ya teen mardon ke haath chipak gaye. To unhon ne kaha: Tum ne khayanat ki hai. Phir wo bail ke sar ke barabar sona le kar aaye. Phir usay us maal-e-ghaneemat mein rakha jo buland jagah par rakha gaya tha. Phir aag aayi aur usay kha gayi. Aur ham se pehlon ke liye maal-e-ghaneemat halal na tha, Allah ne usay hamaray liye halal kiya jab ham mein kamzori dekhi. (Muslim). (Wo Yusha bin Noon thay; buza se murad nikah se sharmgah ka maalik hona hai; khalifat hamila oontni ki jama hai; qarya se murad Bait-ul-Muqaddas hai.)"
"1138","[AI-translation] Mus'ab bin Sa'd se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere baaray mein chaar aayaat naazil huin. Mujhe talwaar mili to main usay Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe ye inaam mein de dijiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Usay rakh do. Phir main khada hua aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Usay wahan se rakh do jahan se tum ne liya. Phir main khada hua aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe ye inaam mein de dijiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Usay rakh do. Phir main khada hua aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe ye inaam mein de dijiye, kya main mohtaj ki tarah rahun ga? Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Usay wahan rakh do jahan se tum ne liya. Phir ye aayat naazil hui: Wo tum se maal-e-ghaneemat ke baaray mein poochtay hain. Kah dijiye: Maal-e-ghaneemat Allah aur Us ke Rasool ka hai. (Muslim). (Muslim mein is hadees mein baaqi teen aayaat ka zikr nahi, ye Muslim ke ustaz Muhammad bin Musanna ka ikhtisar hai.)"
"1139","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Najd ki taraf dastah bheja aur main us mein nikla. To hamein oont aur bakriyan haasil huin. To hamaray hissay barah oont pahunche, aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein aik aik oont inaam mein diya. (Muslim: 5/146). Baab: Anfaal mein se panchwan nikalna."
"1140","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jin daston ko bhejtay thay un mein se baaz ko khaas un ke liye aam lashkar ke hissay ke siwa inaam detay thay, aur is sab mein panchwan wajib hai. (Muslim: 5/147). Baab: Qaatil ko maqtool ka samaan dena."
"1141","[AI-translation] Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Hunain ke saal niklay. Phir jab ham milay to Musalmanon ko shikast hui. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne mushrikon mein se aik mard ko dekha jo Musalmanon mein se aik mard par chadh aaya tha. To main us ki taraf mur kar us ke peechay se aaya aur us ke kandhay ki rag par maara. To wo meri taraf mutawajjah hua aur mujhe aisa dabochay ke mujhe maut ki boo aayi. Phir usay maut ne paa liya to us ne mujhe chhor diya. To main Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se mila. To unhon ne kaha: Logon ko kya hai? To main ne kaha: Ye Allah Taala ka hukm hai. Phir log wapas aaye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baithay. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo qateel ko qatl karay jis par us ke paas gawah ho to us ka samaan us ke liye hai. Unhon ne kaha: To main khada hua aur kaha: Mere liye kaun gawahi de ga? Phir main baith gaya. Phir Aap ne usi tarah farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: To main khada hua aur kaha: Mere liye kaun gawahi de ga? Phir main baith gaya. Phir teesri baar Aap ne usi tarah farmaya to main khada hua. Aakhir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Qatada! Tumhein kya hai? To main ne poora waqiya bayan kiya. Phir aik mard ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Abu Qatada sach kehtay hain. Us ka samaan mere paas hai, to Aap usay raazi kijiye ke wo mujhe mera haq de. To ye sun kar Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, ye kabhi na hoga, aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Allah ke sheron mein se aik sher ko chhor kar Quraysh ki kamzor lomriyon ko dein ge. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha, usay usay de do. To us ne mujhe wo de diya. To main ne us se baagh khareeda aur usay apna pehla maal banaya. (Muslim). (Haa se murad Allah ki qasam hai; baagh se murad us qeemat se baagh khareedna hai.)"
"1142","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Auf (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabke main Badr ke din saf mein khada tha, main ne apne daaein aur baaein dekha to main Ansaar ke do kam umar larkon ke darmiyan tha, main ne tamanna ki ke kaash main un se zyada taqatwar logon ke darmiyan hota. To un mein se aik ne mujhe koch diya aur kaha: Ae chacha! Kya tum Abu Jahl ko pehchantay ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Haan, aur Ae bhatijay! Tumhein us se kya haajat hai? Us ne kaha: Mujhe khabar di gayi hai ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko gaali deta hai. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, agar main usay dekhun to mera saya us ke saaye se juda na hoga yahan tak ke ham mein se pehle marnay wala mar jaye. Unhon ne kaha: To mujhe is par taajjub hua. To doosray ne mujhe koch diya aur usi tarah kaha. Unhon ne kaha: To dair na hui ke main ne Abu Jahl ko logon mein hilta julta dekha. To main ne kaha: Kya tum donon ye apne saathi ko nahi dekhtay jis ke baaray mein tum poochtay thay? Unhon ne kaha: To donon us ki taraf dauday aur apni talwaron se usay maara yahan tak ke usay qatl kar diya. Phir donon Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas wapas aaye aur Aap ko khabar di. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se usay kis ne qatl kiya? Har aik kehnay laga: Main ne usay qatl kiya. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apni talwarein saaf keen? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un donon ki talwaron ko dekha aur farmaya: Tum donon ne usay qatl kiya. Phir us ka samaan Muaz bin Amr bin Jamuh (raziyallahu anhu) ko diya gaya, aur wo donon larkay Muaz bin Amr bin Jamuh aur Muaz bin Afra (raziyallahu anhuma) thay. (Muslim). (Azla se murad donon mein se zyada taqatwar log hain; yazoolo se murad hilna jhulna aur beqarar hona hai; kyunke wohi tha jis ne usay shadeed zakhmi kiya tha, Ibn Afra ka us mein sirf shirkat thi.)"
"1143","[AI-translation] Auf bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Himyar mein se aik mard ne dushman mein se aik mard ko qatl kiya aur us ka samaan lena chaha. To Khalid bin Waleed (raziyallahu anhu) ne usay rok diya jabke wo un par haakim thay. To Auf bin Malik Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne Khalid se farmaya: Tumhein kis ne roka ke tum usay us ka samaan do? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne usay zyada samjha, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne farmaya: Usay usay de do. To Khalid Auf ke paas se guzray to Auf ne un ki chadar khenchi, phir kaha: Kya main ne tumharay liye wo poora kar diya jo main ne tum se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha tha? (Muslim). (Rida khenchnay se murad Khalid ko sharminda karna tha; Aap ne ghussay ho kar farmaya ke Khalid ko na do; aaqaon ki misaal charwahay ki hai.)"
"1144","[AI-translation] Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Hawazin se ghazwa kiya. To jabke ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath nashta kar rahay thay ke surkh oont par aik mard aaya. To us ne usay bithaya, phir us ki pusht se chhalla nikala aur us se oont ko bandh diya. Phir wo aagay badha aur qaum ke saath nashta karnay laga aur dekhnay laga, jabke ham mein kamzori thi aur sawari mein thori thi aur ham mein se baaz paidal thay. To wo nikla aur daudnay laga. Phir wo apne oont ke paas aaya aur us ka bandhan khola, phir usay bithaya aur us par baitha aur usay uthaya. To oont usay le kar dauda. To mailay rang ki oontni par aik mard us ke peechay gaya. Salama ne kaha: Aur main daud kar nikla, pehle main oontni ki raan ke paas tha, phir aagay badha yahan tak ke oont ki raan ke paas ho gaya, phir aagay badha yahan tak ke oont ki mahar pakar li aur usay bithaya. Phir jab us ne zameen par ghutna rakha to main ne apni talwaar nikali aur us mard ke sar par maari to wo gir gaya. Phir main oont ko us ka samaan aur hathyar sameet hank kar laya. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon ke saath thay jo aagay gaye thay. To Aap mujh se milay aur poocha: Is mard ko kis ne qatl kiya? Logon ne kaha: Ibn Akwa ne. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us ka sara samaan Ibn Akwa ke liye hai. (Muslim). (Tadahha se murad nashtay ka waqt hai; talaq se murad bandhan hai; warqa mailay rang wali hai.)"
"1145","[AI-translation] Iyas bin Salama se, apne walid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Fazara se ghazwa kiya jabke ham par Abu Bakr thay jinhein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ham par ameer banaya tha. Phir jab hamaray aur pani ke darmiyan aik ghantay ka fasla tha to Abu Bakr ne hamein hukm diya aur ham ne pichli raat qiyam kiya, phir har taraf se hamla kiya aur pani par pahunche. To jo qatl hua wo qatl hua aur qaidi banaye gaye. Aur main logon ki aik gardan, yani giroh, ko dekh raha tha jin mein bachay thay. To mujhe khauf hua ke wo mujh se pahar ki taraf sabqat le jayein ge. To main ne un ke aur pahar ke darmiyan teer maara. To jab unhon ne teer dekha to ruk gaye. To main unhein hank kar laya. Aur un mein Banu Fazara ki aik aurat thi jis par chamray ka bichhauna tha. Unhon ne kaha: Qash se murad bichhauna hai. Us ke saath us ki beti thi jo Arab ki haseen tareen larki thi. To main unhein hank kar Abu Bakr ke paas laya. To Abu Bakr ne us ki beti mujhe inaam mein di. To ham Madina aaye aur main ne us ka kapra nahi khola tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bazaar mein mujh se milay aur farmaya: Ae Salama! Mujhe wo aurat hiba kar do. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Allah ki qasam wo mujhe pyari hai, aur main ne us ka kapra nahi khola. Agle din Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bazaar mein mujh se milay aur farmaya: Ae Salama! Mujhe wo aurat hiba kar do, aur tumharay walid bohat achay mard thay. Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo Aap ki hai. Allah ki qasam main ne us ka kapra nahi khola. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us larki ko Makka walon ki taraf bheja aur us ke badlay Makka mein qaid Musalmanon ko azaad karaya. (Muslim)"
"1146","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum jis basti mein aao aur us mein qiyam karo to us mein tumhara hissa hai. Aur jo basti Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani karay, yani laray, to us ka panchwan Allah aur Us ke Rasool ke liye hai, phir baaqi tumharay liye hai. (Muslim: 5/151). Baab: Fai kahan kharch ki jaye jab us par laraai se (ghalba) na paya gaya ho. (Nafal se murad yahan ghaneemat hai.)"
"1147","[AI-translation] Malik bin Aus se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne bulaya. To main un ke paas din chadhay aaya. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne unhein un ke ghar mein bistar par baithay paya jo us ki chatai par khula tha, chamray ke takiye se tek lagaye hue. To unhon ne mujh se kaha: Ae Maal! Beshak tumhari qaum ke chand gharanon walay daud kar aaye hain, aur main ne un mein thora maal denay ka hukm diya hai. To usay lo aur un mein taqseem karo. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kaash tum is ka hukm mere siwa kisi aur ko detay. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Maal! Usay lo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Yarfa aaya aur kaha: Ae Ameerul Momineen! Kya Aap ko Usman, Abdur Rahman bin Auf, Zubair aur Sa'd mein raghbat hai? To Umar ne kaha: Haan. To unhon ne unhein ijazat di aur wo dakhil hue. Phir wo aaya aur kaha: Kya Aap ko Abbas aur Ali mein (raghbat hai)? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. To unhon ne un donon ko ijazat di. To Abbas ne kaha: Ae Ameerul Momineen! Mere aur is ke darmiyan faisla kijiye, aur (rawi ne kuch kalam zikr kiya). To qaum ne kaha: Haan, Ae Ameerul Momineen! Un ke darmiyan faisla kijiye aur unhein aaram dijiye. To Umar ne kaha: Tehro! Main tumhein Allah ki qasam deta hun jis ke hukm se zameen aur aasman qayem hain, kya tum nahi jantay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ham anbiya wirasat nahi chhortay, jo ham chhorein wo sadqa hai? Sab ne kaha: Haan, ham jantay hain. Phir Umar Abbas aur Ali (raziyallahu anhuma) ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur kaha: Main tum donon ko Allah ki qasam deta hun jis ke hukm se zameen aur aasman qayem hain, kya tum donon nahi jantay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ham anbiya wirasat nahi chhortay, jo ham chhorein wo sadqa hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Phir Umar ne us maal ka qissa bayan kiya jo Allah ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Madina aur Fadak mein ata kiya aur Khaibar ke khums mein se jo bacha: Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us mein se apne ghar walon ka saal bhar ka kharch detay thay, phir jo bachta usay Allah ke maal mein, yani bait-ul-maal mein rakhtay thay. Phir Abu Bakr ne us mein waisa hi kiya jaisa Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kartay thay. Phir main us ka wali bana, to main ne us mein waisa hi kiya jaisa Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kartay thay aur jaisa Abu Bakr kartay thay. Phir tum donon mere paas aaye: Abbas apne bhatijay ka hissa maangnay aaya aur Ali apni biwi ka hissa apne baap ki taraf se maangnay aaya. To main ne kaha: Agar tum donon chahtay ho to main usay tumhein de dun is shart par ke tum Allah ka ahad lo ke tum us mein waisa hi karo ge jaisa Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kartay thay, jaisa Abu Bakr kartay thay aur jaisa main karta hun. To main ne usay tum donon ko de diya. Phir tum aaye ho mere paas faisla karanay ke tum donon mein se aik doosray ko jhoota, gunahgar, dhokebaaz aur chor kehta hai. Allah ki qasam! Main un ke darmiyan is ke siwa koi faisla nahi karun ga. (Muslim). (Mali se murad Malik ka mukhaffaf hai; radkh se murad thora atiya hai; Yarfa Umar ke khadim thay.)"
"1148","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki beti Fatima (raziyallahu anha) ne Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) ki taraf paigham bheja aur un se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se apni wirasat maangi us maal mein se jo Allah ne Aap ko Madina aur Fadak mein ata kiya aur Khaibar ke khums mein se jo bacha. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ham wirasat nahi chhortay, jo ham chhorein wo sadqa hai. Beshak Aal-e-Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) is maal mein se khatay hain. Aur beshak Allah ki qasam! Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sadqay mein se koi cheez us ki haalat se nahi badlun ga jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay mein thi, aur main us mein waisa hi karun ga jaisa Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kartay thay. To Abu Bakr ne Fatima ko kuch denay se inkar kar diya. To Fatima Abu Bakr par is mein naraaz huin. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne un se qata talluq kiya aur un se kalaam na kiya yahan tak ke wafaat paa gayeen. Aur wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baad chhe maheena zinda rahin. Phir jab wafaat paa gayeen to un ke shohar Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) ne unhein raat ko dafan kiya aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ko ittela na di. Aur Ali ne logon se kaha: Ham mein Abu Bakr ki fazilat ko pehchantay hain aur jo Allah ne unhein diya usay, lekin tum ne ham se is muamlay mein isti'bad kiya. To Abu Bakr ne Ali se kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke rishtadaron se sila rehmi karna mujhe apne rishtadaron se sila rehmi karnay se zyada pasandeeda hai. Phir Ali ne Abu Bakr se dopahar ko bai'at ki jab Abu Bakr ne namaz padhi thi. (Muslim)."
"1149","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere waris deenaar taqseem nahi karein ge. Jo main ne apni biwiyon ke kharch aur apne aamil ki tankhwah ke baad chhora wo sadqa hai. (Muslim: 5/156). Baab: Sawar aur paidal ke hissay."
"1150","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne nafal, yani ghaneemat mein, ghoday ke liye do hissay aur mard ke liye aik hissa taqseem kiya. (Muslim: 5/156). Baab: Auraton ko maal-e-ghaneemat mein se hissa nahi diya jaye ga, unhein inaam diya jaye ga, aur ghazway mein bachon ke qatl ke baaray mein."
"1151","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Hurmuz se riwayat hai ke Najda ne Ibn Abbas ko paanch khaslaton ke baaray mein poochnay ke liye likha. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Agar main ilm chupanay wala na hota to main usay na likhta. Najda ne unhein likha: Amma baad! Mujhe batao, kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) auraton ke saath ghazwa kartay thay, kya Aap un ke liye hissa muqarrar kartay thay, kya Aap bachon ko qatl kartay thay, yateem ka yatim hona kab khatm hota hai, aur khums kis ke liye hai? To Ibn Abbas ne unhein likha: Tum ne mujhe likha ke kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) auraton ke saath ghazwa kartay thay, aur beshak Aap un ke saath ghazwa kartay thay, wo zakhmiyon ka ilaj kartin thin aur maal-e-ghaneemat mein se inaam paati thin, lekin hissay ke taur par Aap ne un ke liye nahi muqarrar kiya. Aur beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bachon ko qatl nahi kartay thay, to tum bachon ko qatl na karo. Aur tum ne mujhe likha ke yateem ka yatim hona kab khatm hota hai? To meri umar ki qasam! Beshak mard ki daadhi nikal aati hai jabke wo apne liye lenay mein kamzor aur us mein se denay mein kamzor hota hai. Phir jab wo logon ke lenay jaisa achay tareeqay se apne liye le to us se yatim hona khatm ho gaya. Aur tum ne mujhe khums ke baaray mein likha ke wo kis ke liye hai? Aur beshak ham kehtay thay ke wo hamaray liye hai, magar hamari qaum ne ham se ye rok liya. (Muslim: 5/197). Baab: Qaidiyon ko chhorna aur un par ehsaan karna. (Najda Haruri Khawarij ka sardar tha.)"
"1152","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Najd ki taraf ghod sawaar bhejay. To wo Banu Hanifa mein se aik mard le kar aaye jinhein Sumama bin Usal kaha jata hai jo Yamama walon ke sardar thay. To unhon ne unhein masjid ke sutunon mein se aik sutun se bandh diya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas niklay aur farmaya: Ae Sumama! Tumharay paas kya hai? Us ne kaha: Ae Muhammad! Mere paas khair hai. Agar tum qatl karo ge to khoon walay ko qatl karo ge, aur agar ehsaan karo ge to shukar guzar par ehsaan karo ge, aur agar tum maal chahtay ho to mango, us mein se jo chaho diya jaye ga. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay chhor diya yahan tak ke aglay din ke baad hua. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Sumama! Tumharay paas kya hai? Us ne kaha: Main ne tum se jo kaha wohi hai: Agar tum ehsaan karo ge to shukar guzar par ehsaan karo ge, aur agar qatl karo ge to khoon walay ko qatl karo ge, aur agar tum maal chahtay ho to mango, us mein se jo chaho diya jaye ga. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay chhor diya yahan tak ke aglay din hua. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Sumama! Tumharay paas kya hai? Us ne kaha: Mere paas main ne tum se jo kaha wohi hai: Agar tum ehsaan karo ge to shukar guzar par ehsaan karo ge, aur agar qatl karo ge to khoon walay ko qatl karo ge, aur agar tum maal chahtay ho to mango, us mein se jo chaho diya jaye ga. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sumama ko azaad kar do. To wo masjid ke qareeb khajooron ki taraf gaya aur ghusl kiya, phir masjid mein dakhil hua aur kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain. Phir us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Zameen par tumharay chehray se zyada naapasandeeda koi chehra na tha, ab tumhara chehra mere nazdeek sab chehron se zyada pasandeeda ho gaya hai. Allah ki qasam! Tumharay deen se zyada naapasandeeda koi deen na tha, ab tumhara deen mere nazdeek sab deenon se zyada pasandeeda ho gaya hai. Allah ki qasam! Tumharay shehar se zyada naapasandeeda koi shehar na tha, ab tumhara shehar mere nazdeek sab shehron se zyada pasandeeda ho gaya hai. Beshak tumharay sawaaron ne mujhe pakra jabke main umrah ka irada rakhta tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay khushkhabri di aur usay umrah ka hukm diya. Phir jab wo Makka aaya to us se kaha gaya: Kya tum deen se phir gaye ho? Us ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, lekin main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Musalman ho gaya hun. Allah ki qasam! Tumharay paas Yamama se gandum ka aik dana na aaye ga yahan tak ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us mein ijazat dein. (Muslim). (Nafal se murad yahan ghaneemat hai.)"
"1153","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabke ham masjid mein thay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamaray paas niklay aur farmaya: Yahud ki taraf chalo. To ham Aap ke saath niklay yahan tak ke ham un ke paas aaye. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khaday hue aur unhein pukara aur farmaya: Ae Yahud ki jamaat! Islam lao, salamti pao ge. Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne pahuncha diya, Ae Abul Qasim! To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Yehi main chahta hun. Islam lao, salamti pao ge. Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne pahuncha diya, Ae Abul Qasim! To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Yehi main chahta hun. Phir Aap ne un se teesri baar farmaya: Jaan lo, zameen Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki hai. Aur beshak main tumhein is zameen se nikalna chahta hun. To tum mein se jo apne maal mein se kuch paye wo usay baichay, warna jaan lo ke zameen Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki hai. (Muslim: 5/159). Baab: Yahud aur Nasara ko Jazeerat-ul-Arab se nikalna. 1153b: Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Main Yahud aur Nasara ko Jazeerat-ul-Arab se zaroor nikalun ga yahan tak ke Musalman ke siwa kisi ko na chhorun ga. (Muslim: 5/160). Baab: Us ke baaray mein hukm jo laray aur ahad toray."
"1154","[AI-translation] (Is mukhtasar ke is taba mein is number ka Arabi matn nahi hai; Khattab ke betay Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees upar 1153 ke aakhir mein aayi hai: Main Yahud o Nasara ko Jazeerat-ul-Arab se zaroor nikalun ga yahan tak ke Musalman ke siwa kisi ko na chhorhun ga.)"
"1155","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd Khandaq ke din zakhmi hue. Quraish mein se aik mard ne unhein teer maara jinhein Ibn Arqa kaha jata hai, us ne unhein akhal (rag) mein maara. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ke liye masjid mein khaima lagaya taake qareeb se un ki iyadat karein. Phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Khandaq se wapas aaye aur hathyar rakha aur ghusl kiya to Aap ke paas Jibreel (alaihissalam) aaye jabke wo apne sar se mitti jhaad rahay thay. To unhon ne kaha: Tum ne hathyar rakhay? Allah ki qasam! Ham ne nahi rakhay. Un ki taraf niklo. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kahan? To unhon ne Banu Quraiza ki taraf ishara kiya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se jang ki. To wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hukm par utray. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un mein hukm Sa'd ki taraf lautaya. Unhon ne kaha: To beshak main un mein hukm karta hun ke larnay walon ko qatl kiya jaye, aulad, auraton ko qaidi banaya jaye aur un ke maal taqseem kiye jayein. Hisham ne kaha: Mere walid ne kaha: Mujhe khabar di gayi ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum ne un mein Allah ke hukm se hukm kiya. Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke tum ne Allah ke hukm se hukm kiya, aur aik baar farmaya ke tum ne baadshah ke hukm se hukm kiya. (Muslim: 5/160). (Hisham ka ye qaul pichli riwayat mein nahi balke doosri hai, musannif ko is par tanbeeh karni chahiye thi; ye Abu Sa'id Khudri ki riwayat se poori hoti hai.)"
